<title>USA: U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON, March 21 (Reuter) USDA report of frozen concentrated orange juice stocks in cold storage, in 1,000s of units:</p>
<p>    -	 02/28/97   01/31/97---Rev from    02/29/96</p>
<p> Gallons     169,874    153,856    149,277     136,718</p>
<p> Lbs	 1,681,075  1,522,559  1,477,241   1,352,962</p>
<p>Note-FCOJ stocks are based on 42.0 degrees Brix equivalent of 9.896 lbs per gallon.</p>
